{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>Write for yourself these words.</b> Although before the calf I said I would give you: לְךָ אֶת לֻחוֹת הָאֶבֶן וְהַתּוֹרָה וְהַמִּצְוָה אֲשֶׁר כָּתַבְתִּי (Exodus 24:12), now that they have sinned, you shall hew the tablets for yourself and I shall write — and I will not also give you the Torah and the commandment which I had written, but you shall write for yourself."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:10.668349865Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}